---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import ClaimBlock from '../components/ClaimBlock.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { release } from '../lib/publication';
import { url } from '../lib/publication';
const selectedClaims = ['C-IMD-OUTLOOK-20260831'].map(id => release.claims.find(c => c.id === id)).filter(Boolean);
---
<Site title="Outlook and recovery"><PageHeader title="What could change?" eyebrow="Outlook & recovery" description="Official forecasts, observed changes and conditional scenarios have different meanings—and different clocks." /><section class="section"><div class="shell grid-2"><div class="empty-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Official outlook</p><h3>Latest outlook not confirmed</h3><p>The 31 August issue is retained below for context. We have not verified whether a later IMD issue supersedes it, so it is not labelled as the active outlook.</p><a href="https://mausam.imd.gov.in/">Check IMD's current bulletins ↗</a></div><div class="empty-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Observed recovery</p><h3>No current recovery finding approved</h3><p>Replenishment, usable storage, groundwater and service restoration require separate dated observations. A rainy day alone does not confirm a recovered supply.</p><a href={url('/data-status/')}>See evidence status ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Conditional pathways</p><h2>Signals that would change an assessment</h2><div class="grid-2"><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Concern could strengthen if…</h3><p>Low catchment rain persists alongside falling usable storage, lagged groundwater recovery, documented supply interruptions and high withdrawals in the same service area. Each link needs its own measurement.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Concern could weaken if…</h3><p>Catchment replenishment is sustained, usable storage improves, service reliability returns and quality testing supports use. Changes must be observed and dated.</p></article></div><p class="small muted" style="margin-top:2rem">These pathways are explanatory scenarios, not a forecast or assigned probability.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell reading"><p class="eyebrow">Reviewed, attributed source records</p><h2>Dated forecast record</h2><p>This 31 August issue was valid for September 2026. Its latest-issue status has not been checked. It is not a measured September outcome.</p>{selectedClaims[0] && <ClaimBlock claim={selectedClaims[0]} heading="31 August outlook, retained for context; current status unverified" />}</div></section></Site>
